    "cues": [
      {"id": "CUE-001", "start": 0, "end": 4.92, "text": "你肯定想不到ai主播已经开始带货了，就在刚刚我参加完京东云大会", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-001.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-001", "SHOT-002"]},
      {"id": "CUE-002", "start": 4.92, "end": 9.48, "text": "在现场体验了不少京东云出品的神器，比如零代码做app和agent", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-002.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-002", "SHOT-003"]},
      {"id": "CUE-003", "start": 9.49, "end": 13.527, "text": "但最让我惊艳的是这些已经上岗直播带货的京东数字人", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-003", "SHOT-004"]},
      {"id": "CUE-004", "start": 13.527, "end": 17.97, "text": "这些数字人已经有超过一万家品牌都在用，一年带货超过一百四十亿", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id": "CUE-005", "start": 17.98, "end": 21.74, "text": "想想你最近买的那些东西，说不定都是ai卖给你的，说实话啊", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-005.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-004", "SHOT-005", "SHOT-006", "SHOT-007"]},
      {"id": "CUE-006", "start": 21.74, "end": 26.77, "text": "我知道京东在电商加ai上憋大招，但没想到他们把数字人做到了这么逼真", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-006.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-007", "SHOT-008", "SHOT-009", "SHOT-010", "SHOT-011", "SHOT-012", "SHOT-013", "SHOT-014", "SHOT-015"]},
      {"id": "CUE-007", "start": 26.78, "end": 31.958, "text": "嘴型和语音的完全同步，这都是一些基本功了，而数字人加真人的双人直播", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-007.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-015", "SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-008", "start": 31.958, "end": 36.31, "text": "Ai和人类一起直播讲解商品，数字人还能走秀展示穿搭", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-008.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-009", "start": 36.32, "end": 40.92, "text": "这个就太赛博了，完全看不出来任何猫腻，就拿大家都知道的安踏来说", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-009.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016", "SHOT-017"]},
      {"id": "CUE-010", "start": 40.92, "end": 43.79, "text": "他们已经在线下旗舰店打造了数字人直播间", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-010.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-017"]},
      {"id": "CUE-011", "start": 43.8, "end": 48.76, "text": "什么商品讲解折扣情况，爆款穿搭的信息全靠这个数字人在讲解", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-011.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-017", "SHOT-018", "SHOT-019"]},
      {"id": "CUE-012", "start": 48.76, "end": 51.52, "text": "也可以和运动裤混搭，打造出不同的时尚造型", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-012.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-019"]},
      {"id": "CUE-013", "start": 51.53, "end": 56.73, "text": "无论哪种搭配，大家都可以轻松驾驭，另外一个童装品牌巴拉巴拉也借助了数字人", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-013.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-019"]},
      {"id": "CUE-014", "start": 56.73, "end": 58.27, "text": "搭建了近十个直播间", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-014.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-019", "SHOT-020"]},
      {"id": "CUE-015", "start": 58.28, "end": 62.32, "text": "并且数字人直播在整个gmv占比高达百分之十五", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-015.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-020", "SHOT-021"]},
      {"id": "CUE-016", "start": 62.32, "end": 64.78, "text": "所有的这些技术都是基于京东数字人", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-016.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-021", "SHOT-022", "SHOT-023"]},
      {"id": "CUE-017", "start": 64.79, "end": 68.71, "text": "这次六幺八更是推出了行业首批高盛宴可用的数字人", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-017.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-023"]},
      {"id": "CUE-018", "start": 68.71, "end": 71.13, "text": "它不仅定制的音色有感情有起伏", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-018.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-023", "SHOT-024", "SHOT-025"]},
      {"id": "CUE-019", "start": 71.14, "end": 75.54, "text": "嘴型同步的很自然，而且针对不同的品类有各种各样的特色主播", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-019.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-025", "SHOT-026", "SHOT-027"]},
      {"id": "CUE-020", "start": 75.54, "end": 80.42, "text": "更重要的是也没有那种ai味儿，各种场景的带货话术，真的就是信手拈来", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-020.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-027", "SHOT-028", "SHOT-029"]},
      {"id": "CUE-021", "start": 80.43, "end": 83.173, "text": "分分钟带火，你会在ai直播间买东西吗？", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-021.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-029"]}
    ]
  },
